[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 604.23, "timestamp": "00:10:04", "text": "好了，我这就把东西都准备好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 607.829, "timestamp": "00:10:07", "text": "我呃，昨天，昨天之后，呃，当我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 610.63, "timestamp": "00:10:10", "text": "直播结束了，我的电脑保持原样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 614.949, "timestamp": "00:10:14", "text": "我没碰它，现在我又回到这里了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 618.069, "timestamp": "00:10:18", "text": "因为昨天晚上整晚都在 Twitch 和 Kick"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 620.79, "timestamp": "00:10:20", "text": "我们看到的就像视频点播一样，所有的一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 623.43, "timestamp": "00:10:23", "text": "奖励和其他一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 630.31, "timestamp": "00:10:30", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 634.069, "timestamp": "00:10:34", "text": "你好。呃，我觉得我快完成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 636.71, "timestamp": "00:10:36", "text": "更多东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 642.23, "timestamp": "00:10:42", "text": "我可以把这个人放在这儿的某个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 644.949, "timestamp": "00:10:44", "text": "关闭它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 655.35, "timestamp": "00:10:55", "text": "好的。下一个。 Switch游戏机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 657.19, "timestamp": "00:10:57", "text": "耶。"}]